agm-0985: AGM H6 Wi-Fi join. bsd/dev/agm_wifi.c gains WPA2 (PMK from the passphrase by PBKDF2, handed to the
firmware in WIFI_CMD_CONNECT for its own 4-way), connect/disconnect/STA-LUT events, sta_leave, and logs the
data channels (8/9) so the real RX format can be read before the data path. agm_wcn_sipc.c gains the data
channel send/forward (agm_sipc_data_send, agm_wifi_data_msg) and no-answer commands.

